Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Dezvoltare de software, Dezvoltare de software personalizat pentru sisteme IT și Servicii IT și consultanță IT
We are looking for an Expert Power BI Developer to support the design, development, and continuous improvement of Business Intelligence and reporting solutions. The role involves transforming data into meaningful insights, creating impactful dashboards and reports, and supporting data-driven decision-making across teams and business functions. You will be a part of the Information Systems Division and you will work alongside a team of project managers, analysts, and PMO professionals.
 👤 Profile: 
 ✅ Strong experience in designing, developing, and maintaining Power BI reporting solutions;
 ✅ Proven experience creating dashboards, reports, and data visualizations that support business decision-making;
 ✅ Good understanding of data modeling concepts and reporting best practices;
 ✅ Experience working with large datasets and translating business requirements into reporting solutions;
 ✅ Strong analytical and problem-solving skills;
 ✅ Ability to interpret complex information and present it in a clear and user-friendly manner;
 ✅ Understanding of data quality, consistency, and governance principles;
 ✅ Comfortable working with Excel and other reporting or analytical tools;
 ✅ Strong communication and stakeholder management skills;
 ✅ Advanced in both English and French;
 ✅ A responsible attitude and ambition in achieving your mission;
 ✅ A good combination of rigor, creativity, and communication skills;
 ✅ Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams;
 ✅ Enthusiasm, self-confidence, innovative problem-solving skills, curiosity, autonomy, and a strong desire to continuously develop your skills.
 ⭐ Nice to Have: 
 ✅ Experience working in Business Intelligence, Data Analytics, or Reporting environments;
 ✅ Exposure to data integration or data transformation activities;
 ✅ Experience working in international and multicultural environments;
 ✅ Knowledge of Agile ways of working;
 ✅ Relevant certifications in Data Analytics or Business Intelligence.
 If you are looking for a role where your expertise can make a real impact and where continuous learning is encouraged, we'd love to hear from you.
